{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gYW40ztxNb1795406525.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第二艘國產大型郵輪「愛達‧花城號」展開商業首航，抵達本港。</p><p></p><p>「愛達‧花城號」早上進入維港，停泊在啟德郵輪碼頭。商業首航昨天由廣州南沙出發，途經本港後前往越南順化。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CRUISE-1030_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vAzW16QMNO1795406666.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「愛達‧花城號」長達341米，容納逾5,200名乘客，是「愛達‧魔都號」的姊妹郵輪，明年以香港為母港，預計營運19個航次。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.577559+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.714553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:21.246961+00:00","content_hash":"4b76b831108aee2d22b5d0ff211ef7d7b1eb8997790cc7be3ad27c87cfff8ca5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.577559+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}